        },
        {
          "text": "Kum lembe nini Mungu wekogi ni awanyakum mi sasa: kum mon migi bende giloko tic mi kurajo ni ma mi kurajo ngo: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.1.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.1.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 1:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "man co bende kumeno, ma giweko tic mi mon ma kurajo, gicwaku mac ther awanya ma rac migi ng’atuman ku wadi man ku wadi, ma co ku co wadi gitimo ko gin m’umaku piny ungo, man ginwang’u cul mi kier migi m’uromogi i igi gigi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.1.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.1.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
